-| Native title clipping | Distinguish a preview from a stored-title change; preserve role/project and full subject receipt when trying one shorter subject label. |
+| Native title clipping | Distinguish a preview from a stored-title change; report the limit without silently shortening role, attitude or project. |
+| NoAttitude or legacy Off; subject NoFocus | Canonical empty labels are NoAttitude and NoFocus; focus is absent from every computed title. |
 | Missing recovery evidence | Unknown fields, no authority reconstructed from the title. |
 | Two same-role candidates in a routing request | Verify project, role, subject and ID; unresolved ambiguity is reported. |
 
